1. Create ArrayBuffer A of size 1024
2. Create Int32Array view over A
3. Resize A to 8 bytes via valueOf callback
4. The stale pointer still points to the old 1024-byte region
5. We can read/write using Atomics operations to memory beyond 8 bytes

